text = "[center][b][font_size=30]LESSON I[/font_size][/b]
[i][color=gray]The Voice of Objects[/color][/i][/center]

The size of an object determines its [b]voice[/b]. In our world, everything that vibrates creates a sound.

[b]The Rule:[/b]
A short string vibrates [color=red]faster[/color] than a long one."
